  "summary": "Programming Experience\n- C#, WPF - 4 years\n- VB.NET, WinForms - 3 years\n- Java - 2 years\n- SQL Server - 2 years\n\nRelated Experience\n- Developed and released kids’ color-learning application on Android and iOS.\n- Developed and released note taking application on Android.\n- Developed Visual Studio Add-In and Extension to add extra features to the Visual Studio Task List.\n- Developed Visual Studio Extension to allow TFS 2008 control through Visual Studio 2013.\n- Created simple bug/issue tracking software using WPF and C# to teach myself custom styling in WPF (available in Github profile).\n- Currently working on a note taking application with Markdown abilities. Still in development, but nearing release. All notes sync through the cloud (currently using Google Drive). Developed as an alternative to Simplenotes note client. This is not available online yet, but I have screenshots and an early beta could be made available if necessary. \n\nGithub Profile\n- https://github.com/chris84948\n- BugTracker application - https://github.com/chris84948/BugTracker\n- Airspace Fixer (WPF bug fix workaround project) - https://github.com/chris84948/AirspaceFixer\n- JustMVVM (simple MVVM framework) - https://github.com/chris84948/JustMVVM\n\nNuget Packages\n- JustMVVM - https://www.nuget.org/packages/JustMVVM\n- AirspaceFixer - https://www.nuget.org/packages/AirspaceFixer/",
